       data-fr="Au-delà des algorithmes : contraintes de déploiement, optimisation, rigueur.">
      Beyond algorithms: deployment constraints, optimization, rigor.
    </p>

    <div class="overlay-skills-grid">
      <div class="overlay-skill-card">
        <div class="overlay-skill-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="overlay-skill-title" data-en="Profiling & Optimization" data-fr="Profilage & Optimisation">Profiling & Optimization</h3>
        <p class="overlay-skill-desc"
           data-en="cProfile, nvprof, CuPy for bottleneck identification. ×12 measured speedup on the AnotherBrain project. Experience moving from CPU reference implementations to GPU-accelerated kernels with memory constraints."
           data-fr="cProfile, nvprof, CuPy pour identifier les goulots d'étranglement. Speedup ×12 mesuré sur le projet AnotherBrain. Expérience dans le passage d'implémentations CPU de référence à des kernels GPU accélérés avec contraintes mémoire.">
          cProfile, nvprof, CuPy for bottleneck identification. ×12 measured speedup on the AnotherBrain project. Experience moving from CPU reference implementations to GPU-accelerated kernels with memory constraints.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="overlay-skill-card">
        <div class="overlay-skill-icon">📦</div>
        <h3 class="overlay-skill-title" data-en="Deployment Constraints" data-fr="Contraintes de Déploiement">Deployment Constraints</h3>
        <p class="overlay-skill-desc"
           data-en="Experience with real-time constraints (~15 FPS) and limited memory. Awareness of dev vs. production gaps. Sliding block computation instead of full-history storage. Design decisions driven by hardware budget."
           data-fr="Expérience avec contraintes temps réel (~15 FPS) et mémoire limitée. Conscience des différences dev/production. Calcul par blocs glissants plutôt que stockage complet de l'historique. Décisions de conception guidées par le budget matériel.">
          Experience with real-time constraints (~15 FPS) and limited memory. Awareness of dev vs. production gaps. Sliding block computation instead of full-history storage. Design decisions driven by hardware budget.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="overlay-skill-card">
        <div class="overlay-skill-icon">📚</div>
        <h3 class="overlay-skill-title" data-en="Scientific Rigor" data-fr="Rigueur Scientifique">Scientific Rigor</h3>
        <p class="overlay-skill-desc"
           data-en="Faithful implementation of research papers (STEI, DSTEI). Systematic comparison with published results. Collaboration with CSO for hypothesis validation. Quantitative benchmarking methodology."
           data-fr="Implémentation fidèle d'articles de recherche (STEI, DSTEI). Comparaison systématique avec les résultats publiés. Collaboration avec CSO pour valider les hypothèses. Méthodologie de benchmarking quantitatif.">
          Faithful implementation of research papers (STEI, DSTEI). Systematic comparison with published results. Collaboration with CSO for hypothesis validation. Quantitative benchmarking methodology.
        </p>
      </div>
